rname>Gajdusek</surname><given-names>D.C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nucleation of amyloidogenesis in infectious and noninfectious amyloidoses of brain</article-title><source>Ann. NY Acad. Sci</source><volume>724</volume><year>1994b</year><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>190</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.1111/j.1749-6632.1994.tb38909.x">doi:10.1111/j.1749-6632.1994.tb38909.x</ext-link><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8030940</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gajdusek</surname><given-names>D.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Salazar</surname><given-names>A.M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Amyotrophic lateral sclerosis and parkinsonian syndromes in high incidence among the Auyu and Jakai people of West New Guinea</article-title><source>Neurology</source><volume>32</volume><year>1982</year><fpage>107</fpage><lpage>126</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7198738</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hadlow</surname><given-names>W.J.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Scrapie and kuru</article-title><source>Lancet</source><volume>274</volume><year>1959</year><fpage>289</fpage><lpage>290</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.1016/S0140-6736(59)92081-1">doi:10.1016/S0140-6736(59)92081-1</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Iler</surname><given-names>R.K.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hydrogen-bonded complexes of silica with organic compounds</article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Benes</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lindqvist</surname><given-names>I.